    "detailed_description": "<strong> Visual Novel Sisters </strong> is a text-visual story based on a Japanese tale of two sisters.<br>This game is a storytelling game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734890/extras/b6f5e625890a02c4b4bd35d7663db51d.avif?t=1747810464\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SISTERS</h2><br>Once upon a time, two sisters lived in the same area. The eldest was a beautiful and kind girl, and the youngest was very angry.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734890/extras/c6b4dcbe34f22734063c3eb66c6101df.avif?t=1747810464\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRAVEL IN THE MOUNTAINS</h2>Two sisters decided to go to the mountains to collect acorns.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734890/extras/f353cc0fd95dea5e42ec21b7238d3a02.avif?t=1747810464\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STRANGE SURPRISE</h2>However, everything turned out to be far from simple ... In this story you will find out what happened next.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734890/extras/3e5b79c184ccd8027eb6ab238d699de2.avif?t=1747810464\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2 girl characters<br></li><li> Spectacular mountainous spaces<br></li><li> Ability to move in space using controls<br></li><li> Narrative with an unusual ending<br></li><li> 10 thematic musical compositions</li></ul>",
